<title>USA: Emerald Isle declares initial payout.</title>
<headline>Emerald Isle declares initial payout.</headline>
<dateline>QUINCY, Mass. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emerald Isle Bancorp Inc announced the first quarterly dividend on the company's outstanding common stock of $0.07 per share on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Emerald Isle, a bank holding company, is the parent company of the Hibernia Savings Bank.  </p>
<p>The dividend is payable on November 1996 to shareholders of record as of October 22 1996.</p>
